    {
      "text": "Remove the Li-ion battery heater harness .",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.13999999999996,
        454.07407079999996,
        280.4064239999999,
        444.83048326408834
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": ": Harness clip",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        83.52,
        300.61429718,
        134.76735657599997,
        293.12379497792267
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING: To prevent electric shock, wear insulated protective gear and use insulated tools.",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.00001199999996,
        280.0737228,
        126.04997999999996,
        270.8301352640883
      ],
      "type": "warning",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "INSTALLATION",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        197.22828718000005,
        132.11253378400002,
        187.08158166300552
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Note the following items, and disassembly in the reverse order of disassembly.",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        183.71591999999998,
        414.9311484000007,
        174.47233246408837
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "DANGER: There is the danger of electric shock caused by contact with the terminals. Be sure to wear insulated protective gear and use insulated tools.",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        169.19607240000005,
        100.97268239999997,
        159.95248486408843
      ],
      "type": "warning",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there is a danger of electric shock and fire, never allow bus bar to contact a wrong terminal.",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        60.65903999999995,
        77.9965128,
        558.5688443999998,
        57.23353366408844
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "-If bus bar contacts a wrong terminal, the circuit becomes energized and a short may occur.",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.13895599999995,
        55.01713319999999,
        512.6651039999997,
        45.773545664088374
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "-Always keep the bus bar cover closed until immediately before the installation of bus bar.",
      "page_pdf": 244,
      "page_manual": "EVB-244",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.13895599999998,
        43.49659320000001,
        505.381324799999,
        34.25300566408839
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "LI-ION BATTERY",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        252.17998,
        769.00991,
        359.8315575999998,
        757.1101191491713
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "-Since the correct installation position for the bus bar connected to both front module stacks is commonly-confused with the wrong position , install the bus bar to the correct position with extreme caution.",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        735.83589,
        559.8573255999999,
        702.6512944640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "CAUTION"
    },
    {
      "text": "Correct position",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        84.48,
        466.63428718,
        143.8286621519999,
        459.1437849779227
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": ": Battery front",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        84.48,
        450.913896598,
        135.29944927019994,
        443.4233943959227
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING: Install the Li-ion battery controller immediately before installing the battery pack upper case. Refer to EVB-214, \"LI-ION BATTERY CONTROLLER : Removal and Installation\".",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.45896600000006,
        430.4952264,
        107.588278,
        421.25163886408836
      ],
      "type": "warning",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "EV Battery Tracking Identification Seal",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        390.01127718,
        222.64461888799985,
        381.19267332046405
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When replacing the Li-ion battery with a new battery, perform the following operation.",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        377.99592,
        446.0144499999988,
        368.7523324640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the date of the (replacement) work on the EV battery tracking identification seal that is packaged together with the new part.",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001000000001,
        366.535932,
        559.8547155999996,
        345.7718044640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the EV battery tracking identification tool into 2 pieces and apply them to the body of the replaced (old) LI-ion battery and to the 'Li-ion battery replacement history record'.",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.4598012,
        343.4960004,
        559.8104499999995,
        322.7924248640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the necessary information in the 'Li-ion battery replacement history record'.",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.45980119999997,
        320.5154724,
        449.6093596000006,
        311.2718848640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Battery Temperature Sensor Harness (Front)",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        292.99137718,
        250.1830505369997,
        284.17277332046405
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Install the battery temperature sensor harness (front) onto the front module stack RH.",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        281.03593,
        447.68077840000063,
        271.7923424640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001000000001,
        60.356358399999976,
        104.63689000000002,
        51.11277086408836
      ],
      "type": "warning",
      "safety_level": "CAUTION"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrong position",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        246.1025690429999,
        466.63428718,
        302.37855556300025,
        459.1437849779227
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "EVB",
      "page_pdf": 245,
      "page_manual": "EVB-245",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        568.37988,
        643.6912671800001,
        588.3435248437999,
        634.8726633204641
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    }
  ],
